s Bank', 'text': 'SALT LAKE CITY--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HOME IMPROVEMENT LENDER ENERBANK USA ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS AGREED TO BE ACQUIRED BY REGIONS BANK, A SUBSIDIARY OF REGIONS FINANCIAL CORPORATION.'}{'symbol': 'RCL', 'date': '2021-06-08 11:54:00-04:56', 'title': "Celebrity Equinox Heats Up Summer Vacation Options As The Latest Ship In The Celebrity Cruises' Fleet To Be Approved To Sail From A U.S. Port Beginning July 25", 'text': "MIAMI, JUNE 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEADING THE WAY WITH THE FIRST SHIP TO SAIL IN NORTH AMERICA JUST DAYS AGO ON JUNE 5,\xa0 CELEBRITY CRUISES' MUCH ANTICIPATED RETURN TO SAILING CONTINUES, AS THE NEW-LUXURY SHIP CELEBRITY EQUINOX HAS NOW BEEN APPROVED BY THE CENTERS FOR DISEASE CONTROL AND PREVENTION (CDC) TO SAIL FROM FORT LAUDERDALE ON JULY 25, 2021. IT WILL CLOSELY FOLLOW CELEBRITY EDGE 'S INDUSTRY-FIRST CRUISE DEPARTURE FROM U.S. WATERS FOR THE CARIBBEAN ON JUNE 26, 2021."}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-06-08 14:38:00-04:56', 'title': 'S&P Global Platts Becomes Data & Insight Provider to OPEC', 'text': 'LONDON, JUNE 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0S&P GLOBAL PLATTS ("PLATTS"), THE LEADING INDEPENDENT PROVIDER OF INFORMATION, ANALYTICS AND BENCHMARK PRICES FOR THE COMMODITIES AND ENERGY MARKETS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT PLATTS HAS BECOME A DATA AND INSIGHT PROVIDER TO THE ORGANISATION OF THE PETROLEUM EXPORTING COUNTRIES (OPEC), BUILDING ON A LONG-TERM RELATIONSHIP.\xa0 SAUGATA SAHA, PRESIDENT, S&P GLOBAL PLATTS, SAID:\xa0"WE ARE PLEASED THAT OPEC RECOGNISES THE VALUE OF PLATTS\' INDEPENDENT PRICE REPORTING AND WORLD-CLASS ANALYTICS INSIGHT.'}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-06-08 12:10:00-04:56', 'title': 'S&P Global Market Intelligence Awarded Best Research Provider and Best Enterprise Data Management Initiative from WatersTechnology', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JUNE 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0S&P GLOBAL MARKET INTELLIGENCE, THE DIVISION OF S&P GLOBAL THAT PROVIDES DATA, ESSENTIAL INSIGHTS AND POWERFUL ANALYTICS TO HELP NAVIGATE THE FINANCIAL 